  "meta": {
    "description": "Monthly dual momentum across US stocks (SPY), ACWI ex-US stocks (VEU) and US aggregate bonds (AGG). If the S&P 500's 12-month total return beats T-bills, hold whichever of SPY and VEU has the higher 12-month return; otherwise hold AGG. Always 100% in a single asset. Run as 4 equal tranches deciding 5 sessions apart, to remove rebalance-timing luck.",
